{"s":[[null,1,[["p",["The Pageboy Cap is a ",["l","帽子","hat"]," that can be purchased from the ",["l","废弃的屋子","Abandoned House"]," for 5,000g after earning the \"Well-Read\" ",["l","成就","achievement"]," (read every ",["l","书","book"],"). It can also be obtained from ",["l","沙漠节","Emily's outfit services"]," at the ",["l","沙漠节","Desert Festival"],". There is a ≈2% chance to receive the gender-neutral outfit with the Pageboy Cap."]]]],["Notes",2,[["l",0,[[1,["The Pageboy Cap outfit also includes the ",["f","Shirt017.png",24]," ",["l","裁缝","Mayoral Suspenders"]," and ",["f","Farmer_Pants.png",24]," ",["l","裁缝","Farmer Pants"]," (dyed RGB value 112,38,22)."]]]]]]]}